OL,3,CLatest hosepipe ban comes into force
OL,4,Cas forecasters warn of flooding
OL,6,FA new hosepipe ban has come into force
OL,7,Fas forecasters warned parts of the UK
OL,8,Fcould be hit by flooding, with rain
OL,9,Fset finally to hit drought-stricken
OL,10,Fland.
OL,12,FSome areas in the country will have
OL,13,Fthe "first meaningful rain for a long
OL,14,Ftime" in the coming days, the Met
OL,15,FOffice said, after weeks of heatwaves
OL,16,Fand dry weather have left many areas
OL,17,Ffacing water shortages.
