OL,3,CLatest hosepipe ban comes into force
OL,4,Cas forecasters warn of flooding
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, a hosepipe ban begins for
OL,7,Fall of Wessex Water's 1.4 million
OL,8,Fcustomers across areas in Bath,
OL,9,FSomerset, Dorset and Wiltshire.
OL,11,FIt is the first ban the company has
OL,12,Fput in place for 50 years, since the
OL,13,Fsummer of 1976.
OL,15,FAnnouncing the temporary restriction,
OL,16,Fthe company cited increased demand
OL,17,Fduring the dry weather but also longer-
OL,18,Fterm weather forecasts that mean
OL,19,Fresources must be protected for
OL,20,Fcustomers and the environment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
