OL,3,CLatest hosepipe ban comes into force
OL,4,Cas forecasters warn of flooding
OL,6,FMore than 27 million people across
OL,7,FEngland have now had hosepipe use
OL,8,Frestricted in their area.
OL,10,FFollowing the fifth heatwave of the
OL,11,Fsummer, this week is forecast to be
OL,12,Fwetter with cooler conditions that are
OL,13,Fmuch closer to average for the time of
OL,14,Fyear, the Met Office said.
OL,16,FShowers are expected on Tuesday in the
OL,17,Fnorth of the country, particularly in
OL,18,Fthe North West, and another area of
OL,19,Frain will move into the South West by
OL,20,Fthe evening, the Met Office's deputy
OL,21,Fchief forecaster Mike Silverstone said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
