OL,3,CLatest hosepipe ban comes into force
OL,4,Cas forecasters warn of flooding
OL,6,FThis will then likely spread east
OL,7,Facross the South, bringing the first
OL,8,Fspell of widespread rain to areas in
OL,9,Fneed the most, he added.
OL,11,F"Thursday will be a day of heavy
OL,12,Fshowers across much of the UK, while
OL,13,Fsome of these will be heavy some areas
OL,14,Fwill miss them altogether," Mr
OL,15,FSilverstone said.
OL,17,F"As some of these showers could be
OL,18,Fintense, there is a chance of some
OL,19,Fsurface water flooding as the rain
OL,20,Ffalls on very dry and hard ground."
