OL,3,CLatest hosepipe ban comes into force
OL,4,Cas forecasters warn of flooding
OL,6,FWildfires have ravaged parts of the UK
OL,7,Ffollowing the hot and dry summer,
OL,8,Fincluding in the West Midlands where a
OL,9,Fblaze in Stourbridge destroyed 19
OL,10,Fhomes.
OL,12,FSeveral fire services have asked
OL,13,Fpeople to call 999 only to report a
OL,14,Fgenuine emergency.
OL,16,FIn an update on Monday, the National
OL,17,FFire Chiefs Council said 1,132
OL,18,Fwildfires have now been recorded
OL,19,Facross England and Wales in 2026 so
OL,20,Ffar ` a record high for the amount
OL,21,Fbetween January and this time of year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
