OL,3,CLatest hosepipe ban comes into force
OL,4,Cas forecasters warn of flooding
OL,6,FOn Friday evening, millions of people
OL,7,Fin England and Wales received an alert
OL,8,Fon their mobile devices warning them
OL,9,Fof a "very high risk of wildfires
OL,10,Fnationally".
